        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Robert Stone, Truman Capote\n- Works: WUSA, A Hall of Mirrors\n- Roles: Novelist, Screenwriter, Playwright, Actor\n\nFacts:\n- Truman Capote was born as Truman Streckfus Persons on September 30, 1924, and he was an American novelist, screenwriter, playwright, and actor.\n- Robert Stone was born on August 21, 1937, and he was an American novelist.\n- WUSA was written by Robert Stone and was based on his novel A Hall of Mirrors.\n- Truman Capote died on August 25, 1984.\n- Robert Stone died on January 10, 2015.",
